# Ignore list for internal API routes excluded from openapi.yaml
#
# Format:
# - One route path or prefix pattern per line (e.g. `/api/internal/*` or `/api/health/ping`)
# - Lines starting with `#` are comments
# - Blank lines are ignored
# - Exact match: `/api/internal/route`
# - Prefix wildcard: `/api/internal/*` matches any subroute under `/api/internal/`

